WEBVTT

NOTE Angle Beam TCG Calibration — Shear Wave
NOTE Language: English (en)
NOTE Source: Rachel narration via ElevenLabs eleven_multilingual_v2

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.200
TCG Calibration for Shear Wave.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.700
A step-by-step tutorial.

3
00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:05.300
Step 1.

4
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.000
Open the Setup Toolbox
on your active channel,

5
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.450
then click the TCG tab
to begin calibration.

6
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2.

7
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Move the probe to the first F.B.H.,

8
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.800
the hole closest to the surface.

9
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.000
Use the Vb or W motion function

10
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.930
to get the maximum signal response.

11
00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.700
Step 3. Click the TCG bar button.

12
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.050
This creates your first TCG point.

13
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:29.500
Step 4. Drag the green dot
onto the first pulse.

14
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.300
Set the point to forty percent F.S.H.

15
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.590
Then amplify the signal
to eighty percent full screen height.

16
00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:38.500
Step 5. Move the probe
to the second F.B.H.,

17
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.800
the middle hole.

18
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.700
Click the TCG bar again

19
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.740
to add your second TCG point.

20
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.200
Two TCG points are now locked in.

21
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.300
Your TCG curve is starting to take shape.

22
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:52.000
Step 7. Move to the third
and deepest F.B.H.

23
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.500
Click the TCG bar one more time

24
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.590
to place the final point.

25
00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.700
Step 8. Save your calibration.

26
00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.640
Don't lose your work.

27
00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.500
Calibration complete.

28
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.700
Your TCG curve is now
ready for scanning.

29
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:05.890
Nice work.
